# Quality Gates

Before claiming a milestone or PR ready:

1. `npm run format:check && npm run lint && npm run typecheck`
2. `npm test` (workspaces) and `npm run verify:plugins`
3. `npm run validate:compose` (and `validate:stack` if Stack changed)
4. Prefer `npm run tools:check` when host Node is unavailable

CI workflows under `.github/workflows/` enforce these on `main`/`develop` and PRs.
Release tags `v*` publish images per `docs/RELEASE.md` and `docs/CI_CD.md`.
